Package: HaploBreedR
Type: Package
Title: Haplotype-Based Breeding Decisions from GWAS and Genotype Data
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person("Akansha", "Singh",
           email = "akansha.iasbhu@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4916-7296"))
Description: Identifies superior haplotypes at candidate genes from
    genome-wide association study (GWAS) hits and genotype data, tests
    haplotype-trait associations, applies effect-size and permutation
    gates, and produces multi-trait breeding recommendations. The
    package includes tools for reference genome preparation, functional
    variant discovery, LD region construction, association testing,
    superior-haplotype identification, multi-trait selection indexing,
    and publication-quality visualization of haplotypes, gene models,
    and LD structure. Methods follow the haplotype-based breeding
    framework described in the accompanying manuscript.
